=== Symbolic c-map as a function from q to c (using generic q,x) ===
c(q, x, y) = 2qy/(q^2 - x^2)  where y^2 = x(x+1)(x+q^2).

For a 1-parameter family of points x = x(q), c becomes a function of q.
For specific MW generators of rank-jump fibers, c specializes to specific values.
These values seem to form a graph structure on the Pythagorean locus.

